flowchart LR
  V0[稳定 Target Agent vN] --> EV[Evolution cases: 同组多题]
  EV --> TR[Trace / Score / Token / Tools / Latency]
  TR --> HYP[跨 Case failure hypothesis + 证据]
  HYP --> PATCH[Evolver: 单次有限 Harness patch]
  PATCH --> CAND[Candidate vN+1 + state snapshot]
  CAND --> EVREG[Evolution regression]
  EVREG --> HOLD[隔离 held-out evaluation]
  HOLD --> GATE{客观分数严格提升且硬错误零新增且留出不退化?}
  GATE -->|通过| PROMOTE[Promote + lineage]
  GATE -->|拒绝| ROLLBACK[Rollback + 原因]
  PROMOTE --> V0
  ROLLBACK --> V0
